          ],
          "text": "The Lion and the Mouse\n"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            48.0,
            380.0,
            562.6581420898438,
            475.17706298828125
          ],
          "text": "A Lion lay asleep in the forest, his great head resting on his paws. A timid\nlittle Mouse came upon him unexpectedly, and in her fright and haste to get\naway, ran across the Lion's nose. Roused from his nap, the Lion laid his\nhuge paw angrily on the tiny creature to kill her.\n"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            48.0,
            641.0,
            561.26416015625,
            687.8443603515625
          ],
          "text": "The Lion was much amused to think that a Mouse could ever help him. But\nhe was generous and finally let the Mouse go.\n"
        },
        {
          "bbox": [
            280.0,
            754.0,
            285.55999755859375,
            767.739990234375
          ],
          "text": "1\n"
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
          "xref": 8,
          "bbox": [
